<title>THAILAND: Thai 1997 daily LPG demand seen rising.</title>
<headline>Thai 1997 daily LPG demand seen rising.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's demand for liquefied petroleum gas in 1997 was seen rising 18 percent from previous year to 5,488 tonnes per day, a senior commerce ministry official said on Monday.</p>
</text>
